# Luna thin UI — text selection & markdown

## In scope for selection
- User and assistant **message body** only (`selectable_text`, `SelectableImageViewer`).
- **Not** selectable: tool bubbles, summary (`ImageViewer`), reasoning/thinking blocks.

## Stack
- Workspace `[patch.crates-io]` → libcosmic iced fork (required; single iced tree).
- `iced_selection` path: `luna_thin_ui/vendor/iced_selection` with features `markdown`, `cosmic`.
- `Catalog for cosmic::Theme` only in vendor `cosmic_catalog.rs` (orphan rules).

## Key files
- `src/ui/widgets/selectable_text.rs` — `bubble_text`, `accent_highlight` (accent @ 0.55α), `accent_rule_style`
- `src/ui/widgets/markdown_viewer.rs` — `SelectableImageViewer`, `styled_table` (custom grid, 1px accent borders, full width)
- `src/ui/widgets/message_bubble.rs` — wiring
- `src/ui/app.rs` — `image_cache`, fetch on parse, clear on `ConversationLoaded`

## Styling rules
- Selection + table chrome: theme **accent**, alpha **0.55** — not `primary.component.hover`.
- Tables: custom row/column + `rule`, not iced `table` (no separator color API). Header row has accent underline.

## Commands
```bash
unset ARGV0 && cargo check -p luna_thin_ui
```

Full doc: `luna_thin_ui/docs/TEXT_SELECTION_AND_MARKDOWN.md`
